abstract: "Explicit covering arrays improving the best known size for 39 parameter sets of the ca-tools covering array table: 13 at strength 3 (v = 5 to 24) and 26 at strength 4 (v = 3, 5, 6, 7, 10, 12), including CA(2736; 4, 10, 6) (previous best 3208), CA(3000; 4, 11, 6) (3671) and CA(1006; 4, 8, 5) (1125). Obtained by orbit search under PGL(2, q), unions of cosets of linear codes over GF(5) and post-optimisation of the published record arrays, with C search programs written by Claude Opus, and verified exhaustively by two independent checkers."
